id=fold3-fingerprint-fix
name=Fold3 fingerprint active-group keeper
version=v1
versionCode=1
author=jason
description=Samsung's fingerprint HAL loses its active user (m_active_group -1) after boot / rild restarts, then rejects enrollment and ignores the sensor. Re-send setActiveGroup(0, /data/vendor_de/0/fpdata).
